{"chapters":[{"title":"Dict plus a recency list","code":"class LRUCache:\n    def __init__(self, capacity):\n        self.cap, self.vals, self.order = capacity, {}, []\n\n    def get(self, key):\n        if key not in self.vals:\n            return -1\n        self.order.remove(key)\n        self.order.append(key)\n        return self.vals[key]\n\n    def put(self, key, value):\n        if key in self.vals:\n            self.order.remove(key)\n        elif len(self.vals) == self.cap:\n            del self.vals[self.order.pop(0)]\n        self.vals[key] = value\n        self.order.append(key)","frames":[{"caption":"<strong>Dict plus a recency list</strong> &mdash; O(n) per operation time, O(capacity) extra space. Running <code>c = LRUCache(2); c.put(1, 1); c.put(2, 2); assert c.get(1) == 1; c.put(3, 3) …</code>. Step through to watch the code work on this input.","line":2,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"self","label":"self","v":["L","R","U","C","a","c","h","e"],"cls":["","","","","","","",""]}],"vars":[["self","'LRUCache'",0],["capacity","2",0]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>self.cap, self.vals, self.order = capacity, {}, []</code> &mdash; returns <code>None</code>; <code>self.cap = 2</code>; <code>self.vals = {}</code>; <code>self.order = []</code>","line":3,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"self.vals","label":"self.vals","v":[],"cls":[],"keys":[]},{"t":"arr","id":"self.order","label":"self.order","v":[],"cls":[],"noidx":true}],"vars":[["self.cap","2",1],["capacity","2",0]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>if key in self.vals:</code> &rarr; <strong>false</strong> (key = 1) &mdash; <code>key = 1</code>; <code>value = 1</code>","line":13,"panels":[{"t":"arr","id":"self.vals","label":"self.vals","v":[],"cls":[],"keys":[]},{"t":"arr","id":"self.order","label":"self.order","v":[],"cls":[],"noidx":true}],"vars":[["self.cap","2",0],["key","1",1],["value","1",1]],"stack":[]},{"caption":"<code>elif len(self.vals) == self.cap:</code> &rarr; <strong>false</strong>","line":15,"panels":[{"t":"